            "review_title": "Review at Bun Cha Que Tre",
            "review_text": "BBB-MLJ\nLondon, United Kingdom414 contributions\n0\nRecommended by Locals\nSep 2026 • Couples\nThis eatery was recommended to us by one of the staff at our hotel as it was where they eat. \n We weren’t disappointed. The Bun Cha Pork was really nice. \nService was quick. Staff were cheerful. Food was plentiful and cheap. \nTwo of us ate, and had a lemon tea each, all for less than £6 (US$7.80, VND190,000). \nNeither of us managed to finish our meal but we both enjoyed it immensely.\nRead more\nWritten September 28, 2026",
